---
import Icon from '../shared/icon.astro'
---

<section id="contact" class="scroll-mt-8">
  <div class="mb-3 flex items-center gap-2.5">
    <p class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm leading-4 font-semibold tracking-wide whitespace-nowrap text-neutral-400">
      <Icon class="size-4 " name="send" />
      Contact
    </p>
    <div class="h-px w-full bg-neutral-700"></div>
  </div>
  <h2 class="mb-6 text-2xl leading-tight font-bold text-neutral-50">
    Need an engineer or a product delivery partner?
  </h2>
  <p class="max-w-2xl text-neutral-400">
    I'm available for full-time roles, fixed-term contracts, and freelance projects. If you need a full-stack engineer
    or a practical web product taken from requirements to production, tell me what you are building, what is not
    working, or where your team needs support. We can discuss it in English or French.
  </p>
  <div class="mt-5 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
    <a
      class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-lg border border-neutral-700 bg-neutral-900 px-4 py-2 text-base font-medium text-neutral-300 transition hover:border-primary-600 hover:bg-neutral-800 hover:text-neutral-50 focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-primary-400 focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-surface focus-visible:outline-none"
      href="mailto:musanziw.m@gmail.com"
      aria-label="Email Wilfried Musanzi at musanziw.m@gmail.com">
      E-mail me
      <Icon class="size-4" name="mail" />
    </a>
    <a
      class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-lg border border-neutral-700 bg-neutral-900 px-4 py-2 text-base font-medium text-neutral-300 transition hover:border-primary-600 hover:bg-neutral-800 hover:text-neutral-50 focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-primary-400 focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-surface focus-visible:outline-none"
      href="https://github.com/musanzi"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noreferrer"
      aria-label="View Wilfried Musanzi on GitHub">
      GitHub
      <Icon class="size-4" name="github" />
    </a>
    <a
      class="inline-flex min-h-11 items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-lg border border-neutral-700 bg-neutral-900 px-4 py-2 text-base font-medium text-neutral-300 transition hover:border-primary-600 hover:bg-neutral-800 hover:text-neutral-50 focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-primary-400 focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-surface focus-visible:outline-none"
      href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/wilfried-musanzi-197381205"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noreferrer"
      aria-label="View Wilfried Musanzi on LinkedIn">
      LinkedIn
      <Icon class="size-4" name="linkedin" />
    </a>
  </div>
</section>
